<p>A private transfer covers this route door-to-door, collecting you directly from your hotel, apartment, or villa in Playa de las Américas and dropping you at your exact destination in Santa Cruz, whether that's the cruise terminal, a hotel, an office, or a private address. Public buses (guaguas, run by TITSA) do connect the two towns, and they're a reasonable option for a solo traveller with no particular schedule to keep. Where a private car makes a clearer difference is for groups, anyone carrying more than a single light bag, or travellers who need to arrive at a fixed time, such as a cruise departure or a meeting, without depending on a bus timetable or transfer at a station along the way.</p>
