    seoTitleEn: "Santa Cruz to Puerto de la Cruz | 30-Minute Private Transfer",
    seoTitleEs: "Santa Cruz a Puerto de la Cruz | Traslado en 30 Minutos",
    metaDescriptionEn:
      "Private chauffeur transfer from Santa Cruz de Tenerife to Puerto de la Cruz, around 30 minutes and 38 km across the north. Fixed price, door-to-door.",
